, soziales und nachbarschaftliches Zentrum in Potsdam-West entstehen soll. Der Planungsprozess ist partizipativ zu gestalten und erfolgt unter Einbindung aller relevanten Akteure sowie gemeinsam mit den Nutzenden und künftigen Betreibern, um die tatsächlichen Nutzungsbedarfe erfassen zu können."},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-ID","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"internalID","type":"id","value":"2"},{"code":"71000000","field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-MainCommodityClassification-ItemClassificationCode","ordinal":0,"scheme":"cpv","type":"classification"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-Name","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"Elektro"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-Note","lang":"DEU","ordinal":0,"type":"text","value":"#Besonders geeignet für:freelance#"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-PlannedPeriod-DurationMeasure","ordinal":0,"type":"number","unit":"MONTH","value":42.0},{"code":"services","field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProject-ProcurementTypeCode","list":"contract-nature","ordinal":0,"type":"code"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProjectLot-ID","is_ref":false,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"Lot","type":"id","value":"LOT-0002"},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProjectLot-TenderingProcess-GovernmentAgreementConstraintIndicator","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":1},{"field_id":"DE1-ProcurementProjectLot-TenderingTerms-AdditionalInformationParty-PartyIdentification-ID","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":null,"type":"id","value":"ORG-0001"},{"field_id":"DE1-TenderingProcess-AuctionTerms-AuctionConstraintIndicator","ordinal":0,"type":"integer","value":0},{"field_id":"DE1-TenderingTerms-AppealTerms-AppealInformationParty-PartyIdentification-ID","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0002"},{"field_id":"DE1-TenderingTerms-AppealTerms-AppealReceiverParty-PartyIdentification-ID","is_ref":true,"ordinal":0,"scheme":"organization","type":"id","value":"ORG-0003"},{"field_id":"DE1-TenderingTerms-AppealTerms-PresentationPeriod-D